    "fr": "Ahhhh! Hi hi-ho! Gyahhhh! Hohoho!{SAUT}Arrrrrrgh! Hi hohoho!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "HIHO.BIN:text:0612",
    "en": " Hee-hohohoho! ...It's my laugh, ho!(*RESPONSE*)",
